+---
+id: task-002-implement-json-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Patch"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch support.
+
+Export `applyPatch(document, patch)` from `src/index.ts`. It must support add, remove, replace,
+move, copy, and test; validate patch operations and JSON Pointers; return a new document without
+mutating the supplied document; and throw when validation or an operation fails. Cover standard
+operations, root replacement/removal, array behavior, escaping, atomicity, and invalid inputs with
+deterministic tests.
